! Temperature<ref>Temperature values determine temperature zones:
−1.0 ≤ T0 ≤ −0.45
−0.45 ≤ T1 ≤ −0.15
−0.15 ≤ T2 ≤ 0.2
0.2 ≤ T3 ≤ 0.55
0.55 ≤ T4 ≤ 1.0
A temperature outside of [−1.0, 1.0] will inherit the nearest temperature zone.</ref> !! Humidity<ref>Humidity values determine humidity zones:
−1.0 ≤ H0 ≤ −0.35
−0.35 ≤ H1 ≤ −0.1
−0.1 ≤ H2 ≤ 0.1
0.1 ≤ H3 ≤ 0.3
0.3 ≤ H4 ≤ 1.0
A humidity outside of [−1.0, 1.0] will inherit the nearest humidity zone.</ref> !! Continentalness<ref>Continentalness values determine continentalness zones:
−1.2 ≤ C0 ≤ −1.05
−1.05 ≤ C1 ≤ −0.455
−0.455 ≤ C2 ≤ −0.19
−0.19 ≤ C3 ≤ −0.11
−0.11 ≤ C4 ≤ 0.03
0.03 ≤ C5 ≤ 0.3
0.3 ≤ C6 ≤ 1.0
A continentalness outside of [−1.2, 1.0] will inherit the nearest continentalness zone.</ref> !! Erosion<ref>Erosion values determine erosion zones:
−1.0 ≤ E0 ≤ −0.78
−0.78 ≤ E1 ≤ −0.375
−0.375 ≤ E2 ≤ −0.2225
−0.2225 ≤ E3 ≤ 0.05
0.05 ≤ E4 ≤ 0.45
0.45 ≤ E5 ≤ 0.55
0.55 ≤ E6 ≤ 1.0
An erosion outside of [−1.0, 1.0] will inherit the nearest erosion zone.</ref> !! Peaks and Valleys<ref>PV = 1−|(3|weirdness|)−2|. PV values determine PV zones:
−1.0 ≤ PV0 ≤ −0.85
−0.85 ≤ PV1 ≤ −0.2
−0.2 ≤ PV2 ≤ 0.2
0.2 ≤ PV3 ≤ 0.7
0.7 ≤ PV4 ≤ 1.0
A PV outside of [−1.0, 1.0] will inherit the nearest PV zone.</ref> !! Weirdness
